{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AXDawr2gCsZ5NEVSPJyXSd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer to your question about the companion metadata change KIP for the Diskless Topics design (KIP-1150).\\\\n\\\\n**Answer**: The companion metadata change KIP (**KIP-1181**) was **merged into the main design KIP (KIP-1163)**, not kept independent.\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in the discussions.md file:\\\\n\\\\n> **Related KIPs and References**\\\\n> - **KIP-1163**: High-level design and architectural details\\\\n> - **KIP-1164**: Compaction for tiered storage feature\\\\n> - **KIP-1181**: Metadata changes **(now incorporated into KIP-1163)**\\\\n> - **KIP-1176**: Tiered Storage for Active Log Segments (withdrawn in favor of KIP-1150)\\\\n\\\\nThe relevant context also shows that when Jun Rao requested clarifications on KIP-1150 (2026-01-12), one of his points was:\\\\n\\\\n> **JR12**: Update follow-up KIPs (KIP-1164, KIP-1181); metadata changes from KIP-1181 now included in KIP-1163\\\\n\\\\n**Files cited**:\\\\n- `/store/discussions.md` (lines 633-638, particularly the \\\\\\\"Related KIPs and References\\\\\\\" section)\\\\n- `/store/index.md` (line 533: \\\\\\\"KIP-1150 (Diskless) → KIP-1163, KIP-1181, KIP-1164 (related designs)\\\\\\\")\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"index.md\\\",\\\"discussions.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":20.25,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":152321,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":54691,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1318371,\\\"input_tokens\\\":58,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1433}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31805239-4ef2-443f-8ceb-2d490ac28b75","uuid":"ba6b4857-f19d-47d6-b0c3-44720ef97b78","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:28:06.986Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer to your question about the companion metadata change KIP for the Diskless Topics design (KIP-1150).\\\\n\\\\n**Answer**: The companion metadata change KIP (**KIP-1181**) was **merged into the main design KIP (KIP-1163)**, not kept independent.\\\\n\\\\nThis is documented in the discussions.md file:\\\\n\\\\n> **Related KIPs and References**\\\\n> - **KIP-1163**: High-level design and architectural details\\\\n> - **KIP-1164**: Compaction for tiered storage feature\\\\n> - **KIP-1181**: Metadata changes **(now incorporated into KIP-1163)**\\\\n> - **KIP-1176**: Tiered Storage for Active Log Segments (withdrawn in favor of KIP-1150)\\\\n\\\\nThe relevant context also shows that when Jun Rao requested clarifications on KIP-1150 (2026-01-12), one of his points was:\\\\n\\\\n> **JR12**: Update follow-up KIPs (KIP-1164, KIP-1181); metadata changes from KIP-1181 now included in KIP-1163\\\\n\\\\n**Files cited**:\\\\n- `/store/discussions.md` (lines 633-638, particularly the \\\\\\\"Related KIPs and References\\\\\\\" section)\\\\n- `/store/index.md` (line 533: \\\\\\\"KIP-1150 (Diskless) → KIP-1163, KIP-1181, KIP-1164 (related designs)\\\\\\\")\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"index.md\\\",\\\"discussions.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":20.25,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":152321,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":54691,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1318371,\\\"input_tokens\\\":58,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1433}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer to your question about the companion metadata change KIP for the Diskless Topics design (KIP-1150).\\n\\n**Answer**: The companion metadata change KIP (**KIP-1181**) was **merged into the main design KIP (KIP-1163)**, not kept independent.\\n\\nThis is documented in the discussions.md file:\\n\\n> **Related KIPs and References**\\n> - **KIP-1163**: High-level design and architectural details\\n> - **KIP-1164**: Compaction for tiered storage feature\\n> - **KIP-1181**: Metadata changes **(now incorporated into KIP-1163)**\\n> - **KIP-1176**: Tiered Storage for Active Log Segments (withdrawn in favor of KIP-1150)\\n\\nThe relevant context also shows that when Jun Rao requested clarifications on KIP-1150 (2026-01-12), one of his points was:\\n\\n> **JR12**: Update follow-up KIPs (KIP-1164, KIP-1181); metadata changes from KIP-1181 now included in KIP-1163\\n\\n**Files cited**:\\n- `/store/discussions.md` (lines 633-638, particularly the \\\"Related KIPs and References\\\" section)\\n- `/store/index.md` (line 533: \\\"KIP-1150 (Diskless) → KIP-1163, KIP-1181, KIP-1164 (related designs)\\\")\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"store\",\"index.md\",\"discussions.md\"],\"seconds\":20.25,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":2,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":152321,\"cache_write_tokens\":54691,\"cost_usd\":0.1318371,\"input_tokens\":58,\"output_tokens\":1433}}"}}}
